---
const education = [
  {
    degree: "MSc Computer Science & Engineering",
    school: "Eindhoven University of Technology (TU/e)",
    meta: "2023 – 2025 · GPA 7.12/10 · Eindhoven, Netherlands",
    logo: "/assets/logos/tue.png"
  },
  {
    degree: "BTech Computer Engineering",
    school: "Jamia Millia Islamia",
    meta: "2019 – 2023 · Grade 8.54/10 · New Delhi, India",
    logo: "/assets/logos/jmi.png"
  }
];
---

<section id="about" class="section">
  <div class="container about-grid">
    <div class="reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">About</span>
      <h2 class="headline">Research-grade ideas, production-grade systems.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="about-body reveal">
      <p class="about-lede">
        I care about taking models from experimentation to real production impact, and about the
        infrastructure that makes that possible at scale.
      </p>
      <p>
        At <strong>Supercomputing Brabant</strong> and the <strong>TU/e Supercomputing Center</strong> I work on
        GPU workload optimisation and AI infrastructure for the SPIKE cluster, whose Spike-A extension runs on
        NVIDIA DGX B300. I help Brabant-based companies get their AI workloads running at scale. Before that, at
        <strong>Vencomatic Group</strong>, I built anomaly detection models, Azure data pipelines and dashboards
        for industrial automation, after a master’s thesis there that cut sorting errors in half.
      </p>
      <p>
        As co-founder of <strong>LoopIt.ai</strong>, I led technical strategy and system architecture for an
        AI vehicle damage detection platform and mentored several cohorts of university interns. It won the
        EAISI AI Incentive Award.
      </p>

      <h3 class="edu-title">Education</h3>
      <ul class="edu-list">
        {education.map(item => (
          <li class="edu-item">
            <img src={item.logo} alt="" class="edu-logo" loading="lazy" />
            <div>
              <p class="edu-degree">{item.degree}</p>
              <p class="edu-school">{item.school}</p>
              <p class="edu-meta">{item.meta}</p>
            </div>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.15fr;
    gap: 64px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .about-body p {
    font-size: 19px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .about-body p.about-lede {
    font-size: clamp(21px, 2.2vw, 28px);
    line-height: 1.3;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .about-body strong {
    color: var(--text);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .edu-title {
    margin-top: 40px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .edu-list {
    list-style: none;
  }

  .edu-item {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 16px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--hairline);
  }

  .edu-logo {
    width: 72px;
    height: 56px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    object-fit: contain;
    background: #ffffff;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    padding: 6px;
  }

  .about-body .edu-degree,
  .about-body .edu-school,
  .about-body .edu-meta {
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.35;
  }

  .about-body .edu-degree {
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .about-body .edu-school {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .about-body .edu-meta {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
  }

  @media (max-width: 834px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 32px;
    }
  }
</style>
